OL,3,GNEWSABook highlights neurodivergent
OL,4,A'unsung heroes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe book, This is Us, explores what
OL,7,Feach member of the group did over the
OL,8,Fcourse of a year at Shine sessions,
OL,9,Fwhich are designed to improve
OL,10,Fself-esteem, self-expression and
OL,11,Fconfidence.
OL,13,F"[They're] unsung heroes, people that
OL,14,Fyou would never normally hear about or
OL,15,Fknow what they were up to," Chandler
OL,16,Fsaid.
